      "writtenOn": "2021-06-28T07:48:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What should the code do if both of these are true and the configuration says to use NCM for USB tethering?\n\nIn such a case, I don\u0027t think Tethering will ever ask UsbManager to enable both functions at the same time, but other parts of the system might talk to UsbManager directly and enable both functions at the same time. If they do, this code should do something sensible, or at least not crash... do we have a test that checks what happens in this case?\n\nI think the previous code would just ignore NCM and bring up RNDIS. We could do the same in the new code perhaps.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1065,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1066,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "bfcb4cf6c56c0ca49c5bcec4c0f7002b6c24eaf1",
